msgid ""
"Welcome to RECALBOX for Odroid Go Advance!\n"
"This little presentation will show you how to use the 6 special buttons "
"available right under the screen.\n"
"\n"
"Press any button to start!"
msgstr ""
"Ongi etorri RECALBOX-era Odroid Go Advance-rentzat!\n"
"Aurkezpen txiki honek pantailaren azpian dauden 6 botoi berezi erabiltzen "
"erakutsiko dizu.\n"
"\n"
"Sakatu edozein botoi hasteko!"

msgid ""
"The leftmost button is the SELECT button, marked with a 'I', also available "
"on most modern pads.\n"
"But it is also the HOTKEY button that you can use in conjunction with other "
"buttons in most emulators.\n"
"For example, you can use HOTKEY+START to quit the current game.\n"
"\n"
"Press the SELECT button."
msgstr ""
"Ezkerreneko botoia SELECT botoia da, 'I' batekin markatuta, kontrolagailu "
"moderno gehienetan ere eskuragarri.\n"
"Baina HOTKEY botoia ere bada, beste botoiekin batera erabil dezakezuna "
"emuladore gehienetan.\n"
"Adibidez, HOTKEY+START erabil dezakezu uneko jokoa uzteko.\n"
"\n"
"Sakatu SELECT botoia."

msgid ""
"Next to the SELECT button is the START button, marked with an 'II'.\n"
"Use it to open the main menu in the Recalbox interface and use it in-game as "
"the regular START button available on most consoles.\n"
"\n"
"Press this START button please."
msgstr ""
"SELECT botoiaren ondoan START botoia dago, 'II' batekin markatuta.\n"
"Erabili menu nagusia Recalbox interfazean irekitzeko eta jokoan zehar "
"kontsola gehienetan eskuragarri dagoen START botoi arrunta bezala "
"erabiltzeko.\n"
"\n"
"Sakatu START botoi hau, mesedez."

msgid ""
"Then, there are 2 buttons marked with a 'III' and a 'IV'.\n"
"Use them to raise or lower the volume at any time in the Recalbox interface "
"or in-game.\n"
"\n"
" Press either volume up or down (III/IV)."
msgstr ""
"Ondoren, 'III' eta 'IV' markatutako 2 botoi daude.\n"
"Erabili haiek bolumena igotzeko edo jaisteko edonoiz Recalbox interfazean "
"edo jokoan zehar.\n"
"\n"
" Sakatu bolumena igotzeko edo jaisteko (III/IV)."

msgid ""
"The last two buttons marked 'V' and 'VI' are useful to make your screen "
"darker or brighter.\n"
"Note that the brighter the screen, the more power it consumes!\n"
"\n"
" Press either brightness up or down (V/VI)."
msgstr ""
"'V' eta 'VI' markatutako azken bi botoiak erabilgarriak dira zure pantaila "
"ilunagoa edo argitsuagoa egiteko.\n"
"Kontuan izan pantaila zenbat eta argitsuagoa izan, orduan eta energia "
"gehiago kontsumitzen duela!\n"
"\n"
"Sakatu distira igotzeko edo jaisteko (V/VI)."

msgid ""
"Now you're ready to start your RETROGAMING experience with Recalbox! Press "
"button B to start... and PLAY AGAIN!"
msgstr ""
"Orain zure RETROGAMING esperientzia Recalbox-ekin hasteko prest zaude! "
"Sakatu B botoia hasteko... eta JOLASTU BERRIRO!"

msgid "WELCOME TO RECALBOX!"
msgstr "ONGI ETORRI RECALBOX-ERA!"

msgid ""
"Just a few words about the POWER button.\n"
"Make a short press, just like a mouse click, and your console will enter "
"sleep mode. Make another short press and your console will restart instanly! "
"Work in Recalbox interface and in-game!\n"
"\n"
"Press button B to continue."
msgstr ""
"POWER botoiari buruzko hitz gutxi batzuk.\n"
"Sakatu labur, saguaren klik bat bezala, eta zure kontsola lo moduan sartuko "
"da. Egin beste sakatu labur bat eta zure kontsola berehala berrabiaraziko "
"da! Recalbox interfazean eta jokoan zehar funtzionatzen du!\n"
"\n"
"Sakatu B botoia jarraitzeko."

msgid ""
"If you push the POWER button more than 2 seconds, this will power-off your "
"console. If you do so in-game, Recalbox will close the current emulator "
"gracefully.\n"
"Just in case, holding the POWER button down more than 5s perform an hard "
"power-off.\n"
"\n"
"Press button B to continue."
msgstr ""
"POWER botoia 2 segundo baino gehiago sakatzen baduzu, zure kontsola itzaliko "
"da. Jokoan zehar egiten baduzu, Recalboxek uneko emuladorea era egokian "
"itxiko du.\n"
"Badaezpada, POWER botoia 5 segundo baino gehiago sakatuta mantentzeak "
"itzaltze gogorra egingo du.\n"
"\n"
"Sakatu B botoia jarraitzeko."

msgid ""
"One more thing to know: If you plug in or unplug your headphones in the jack "
"connector, Recalbox will automatically switch the audio output. Convenient.\n"
"\n"
"Press button B, as usual."
msgstr ""
"Beste gauza bat jakiteko: aurikularrak jack konektorean konektatzen edo "
"deskonektatzen badituzu, Recalboxek automatikoki aldatuko du audio-irteera. "
"Erosoa.\n"
"\n"
"Sakatu B botoia, ohi bezala."

