msgstr "EXEKUTATU HONEKIN"

msgid ""
"Welcome to RECALBOX for Odroid Go Super!\n"
"This little presentation will show you how to use all the special buttons "
"available all around the screen.\n"
"\n"
"Press any button to start!"
msgstr ""
"Ongi etorri RECALBOX-era Odroid Go Super-entzat!\n"
"Aurkezpen txiki honek pantailaren inguruan dauden botoi berezi guztiak "
"erabiltzen erakutsiko dizu.\n"
"\n"
"Sakatu edozein botoi hasteko!"

msgid ""
"The top-left black button is the SELECT button, also available on most "
"modern pads.\n"
"But it is also the HOTKEY button that you can use in conjunction with other "
"buttons in most emulators.\n"
"For example, you can use HOTKEY+START to quit the current game.\n"
"\n"
"Press the SELECT button."
msgstr ""
"Goiko ezkerreko botoi beltza SELECT botoia da, kontrolagailu moderno "
"gehienetan ere eskuragarri.\n"
"Baina HOTKEY botoia ere bada, beste botoiekin batera erabil dezakezuna "
"emuladore gehienetan.\n"
"Adibidez, HOTKEY+START erabil dezakezu uneko jokoa uzteko.\n"
"\n"
"Sakatu SELECT botoia."

msgid ""
"At the opposite side of the SELECT button is the START button.\n"
"Use it to open the main menu in the Recalbox interface and use it in-game as "
"the regular START button available on most consoles.\n"
"\n"
"Press this START button please."
msgstr ""
"SELECT botoiaren aurkako aldean START botoia dago.\n"
"Erabili menu nagusia Recalbox interfazean irekitzeko eta jokoan zehar "
"kontsola gehienetan eskuragarri dagoen START botoi arrunta bezala "
"erabiltzeko.\n"
"\n"
"Sakatu START botoi hau, mesedez."

msgid ""
"Then, on the top of the console, there are 2 buttons marked with a '-' and a "
"'+'.\n"
"Use them to raise or lower the volume at any time in the Recalbox interface "
"or in-game.\n"
"\n"
" Press any button to continue"
msgstr ""
"Ondoren, kontsolaren goiko aldean, '-' eta '+' markatutako 2 botoi daude.\n"
"Erabili haiek bolumena igotzeko edo jaisteko edonoiz Recalbox interfazean "
"edo jokoan zehar.\n"
"\n"
" Sakatu edozein botoi jarraitzeko"

msgid ""
"The two bottom-left gray buttons control the screen brightness.\n"
"Note that the brighter the screen, the more power it consumes!\n"
"\n"
" Press either brightness up or down button"
msgstr ""
"Beheko ezkerreko bi botoi grisek pantailaren distira kontrolatzen dute.\n"
"Kontuan izan pantaila zenbat eta argitsuagoa izan, orduan eta energia "
"gehiago kontsumitzen duela!\n"
"\n"
" Sakatu distira igotzeko edo jaisteko botoia"

msgid ""
"Finally, the two bottom-right gray buttons are third left & right triggers "
"(L3/R3), only usefull in some emulators or to record videos.\n"
"\n"
" Press either L3 or R3"
msgstr ""
"Azkenik, beheko eskuineko bi botoi grisak hirugarren ezkerreko eta eskuineko "
"abiarazleak dira (L3/R3), emuladore batzuetan bakarrik erabilgarriak edo "
"bideoak grabatzeko.\n"
"\n"
" Sakatu L3 edo R3"

