msgstr "JATORRIZKOA"

msgid ""
"The card could not be read.\n"
"This problem can probably be fixed by blowing on the card's contacts!"
msgstr ""
"Txartela ezin izan da irakurri.\n"
"Arazo hau ziurrenik txartelaren kontaktuen gainean putz eginez konpon "
"daiteke!"

msgid ""
"A card has been detected but is not yet associated with a game. Use START "
"menu on a game to associate."
msgstr ""
"Txartel bat antzeman da baina oraindik ez dago jokoarekin lotuta. Erabili "
"START menua joko batean lotzeko."

msgid "Arcade"
msgstr "Arcade"

msgid ""
"The Recalbox team thanks you for your trust!\n"
"\n"
"Let's take advantage of this first launch to discover together how to use:\n"
"- your Recalbox"
msgstr ""
"Recalbox taldeak eskerrak ematen dizkizu zure konfiantzagatik!\n"
"\n"
"Aprobetxatu dezagun lehen abiarazte hau elkarrekin erabiltzen ikasteko:\n"
"- zure Recalbox"

msgid "and its Recaltower"
msgstr "eta bere Recaltower"

msgid "- your controller"
msgstr "- zure kontrolagailua"

msgid "- your Recalbox RGB DUAL 2"
msgstr "- zure Recalbox RGB DUAL 2"

msgid "- your Recalbox RGB JAMMA 2"
msgstr "- zure Recalbox RGB JAMMA 2"

msgid "- your Recalbox Card Reader"
msgstr "- zure Recalbox Txartel Irakurgailua"

msgid "Please connect your controller via USB and press X to continue."
msgstr ""
"Mesedez konektatu zure kontrolagailua USB bidez eta sakatu X jarraitzeko."

msgid "Controller"
msgstr "Kontrolagailua"

msgid ""
"You can navigate through the menus using the directional pad, **select a "
"system**, or start a game with the **B button**. The **A button** allows you "
"to exit a menu or game list.\n"
"\n"
"Access the **main menu** using the **START button**.\n"
"To exit a game, press the SELECT and START buttons simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"Menuetan nabigatu dezakezu norabide-pad erabiliz, **hautatu sistema bat**, "
"edo abiarazi joko bat **B botoiarekin**. **A botoiak** menu edo joko-"
"zerrenda batetik irtetzeko aukera ematen dizu.\n"
"\n"
"Sartu **menu nagusira** **START botoia** erabiliz.\n"
"Joko batetik irteteko, sakatu SELECT eta START botoiak aldi berean."

msgid "RGB JAMMA 2"
msgstr "RGB JAMMA 2"

msgid ""
"You can navigate through the menus using the joystick, **select a system**, "
"or start a game with the **button 1**. The **button 2** allows you to exit a "
"menu or game list.\n"
"\n"
"Access the **main menu** using the **START button**.\n"
"To **exit a game**, **press and hold START** for 4 seconds and release."
msgstr ""
"Menuetan nabigatu dezakezu joystick-a erabiliz, **hautatu sistema bat**, edo "
"abiarazi joko bat **1 botoiarekin**. **2 botoiak** menu edo joko-zerrenda "
"batetik irtetzeko aukera ematen dizu.\n"
"\n"
"Sartu **menu nagusira** **START botoia** erabiliz.\n"
"**Joko batetik irteteko**, **sakatu eta mantendu START** 4 segundoz eta "
"askatu."

msgid "RGB DUAL 2"
msgstr "RGB DUAL 2"

msgid ""
"Your Recalbox RGB DUAL 2 has been detected and installed automatically! You "
"can now enjoy **all your games** on Recalbox with **perfect pixels and "
"frequency**!"
msgstr ""
"Zure Recalbox RGB DUAL 2 antzeman da eta automatikoki instalatu da! Orain "
"**zure joko guztiak** goza ditzakezu Recalbox-en **pixel eta maiztasun "
"perfektuekin**!"

msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Consider this: you can automatically switch back to **HDMI mode** by "
"connecting an HDMI cable and restarting Recalbox!"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Kontuan izan hau: automatikoki **HDMI modura** itzul zaitezke HDMI kable bat "
"konektatuz eta Recalbox berrabiaraziz!"

msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"An HDMI cable has been detected and the “HDMI priority” mode is enabled in "
"the options. To switch back to CRT mode, disconnect the HDMI cable and "
"restart, or disable the HDMI priority option in the Recalbox RGB DUAL 2 "
"(START) menu options."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"HDMI kable bat antzeman da eta “HDMI lehentasuna” modua gaituta dago "
"aukeretan. CRT modura itzultzeko, deskonektatu HDMI kablea eta berrabiarazi, "
"edo desgaitu HDMI lehentasunaren aukera Recalbox RGB DUAL 2 (START) menuaren "
"aukeretan."

msgid "Recalbox Card Reader"
msgstr "Recalbox Txartel Irakurgailua"

msgid ""
"Your Recalbox Card Reader has been detected and **installed automatically!"
"**\n"
"\n"
"You can start using it right away by **inserting a card** into the reader "
"and going to the game of your choice to **associate the game and card** "
"using the **menu** available with the **START** button."
msgstr ""
"Zure Recalbox Txartel Irakurgailua antzeman da eta **automatikoki instalatu "
"da!**\n"
"\n"
"Berehala erabiltzen has zaitezke **txartel bat sartuz** irakurgailuan eta "
"zure aukeraketako jokora joanez **jokoa eta txartela lotzeko** **START** "
"botoiarekin eskuragarri dagoen **menua** erabiliz."

msgid "Add games"
msgstr "Gehitu jokoak"

msgid ""
"Recalbox shares its ROM, BIOS, and save files folders on the local network. "
"Adding your ROMs couldn't be easier: on your computer, search for your "
"“recalbox” in the network shares.\n"
"Go to the ROMs folder, then copy your game to the folder corresponding to "
"its system. For example, to add a “NES” game, copy it to the ‘roms/nes’ "
"folder."
msgstr ""
"Recalboxek bere ROM, BIOS eta gordetze-fitxategien karpetak partekatzen ditu "
"sare lokalean. Zure ROM-ak gehitzea ezin da errazago izan: zure "
"ordenagailuan, bilatu zure “recalbox” sareko partekatzeetan.\n"
"Joan ROM-en karpetara, eta gero kopiatu zure jokoa bere sistemari dagokion "
"karpetara. Adibidez, “NES” joko bat gehitzeko, kopiatu ‘roms/nes’ karpetara."

msgid ""
"Remember to connect your Recalbox to the internet to enjoy all its "
"features!\n"
msgstr ""
"Gogoratu zure Recalbox internetera konektatzea bere eginbide guztiez "
"gozatzeko!\n"

msgid ""
"Updates will be offered to you automatically.\n"
"\n"
"Find useful information and tutorials at recalbox.com, or on the recalbox "
"wiki by scanning the QR code."
msgstr ""
"Eguneraketak automatikoki eskainiko zaizkizu.\n"
"\n"
"Aurkitu informazio eta tutorial baliagarriak recalbox.com-en, edo recalbox "
"wiki-an QR kodea eskaneatuz."

