"available SHARE partition ({SIZE_AVAIL}).\n"
"\n"
"Please use a larger disk or free up space on /recalbox/share first."
msgstr ""
"Ez dago nahikoa leku helburuko diskoan.\n"
"\n"
"**/recalbox/share**-(r)en edukia ({SIZE_SHARE}) ez da SHARE partizio "
"erabilgarrian ({SIZE_AVAIL}) sartzen.\n"
"\n"
"Erabili disko handiago bat edo askatu lekua /recalbox/share-(e)n lehenik."

